# Hardware Inventory Report


{% for host in ansible_play_hosts %}
{% set hvars = hostvars[host] %}
## System: {{ host }}

| Field        | Value                              |
|--------------|------------------------------------|
| **Product** | {{ hvars.hw_product }}             |
| **Vendor** | {{ hvars.hw_vendor }}              |
| **Serial** | {{ hvars.hw_serial }}              |
| **OS** | {{ hvars.ansible_distribution }} {{ hvars.ansible_distribution_version }} |
| **RAM** | {{ hvars.ansible_memtotal_mb }} MB |
| **CPU Cores**| {{ hvars.ansible_processor_vcpus }} |

### Storage
{% for device in ansible_devices %}
{% if 'sd' in device or 'nvme' in device or 'vd' in device or 'hd' in device %}
- **{{ device }}** — {{ ansible_devices[device].size | default('N/A') }} ({{ ansible_devices[device].model | default('N/A') }})
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

### Network Interfaces
{% for iface in ansible_interfaces %}
{% if not iface.startswith(('veth', 'tap', 'br-', 'docker')) and iface != 'lo' %}
{% set iface_detail = hostvars[inventory_hostname]['ansible_' + iface] | default({}) %}
- **{{ iface }}** — {{ iface_detail.ipv4.address | default('No IPv4') }} / {{ iface_detail.macaddress | default('N/A') }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}